Money transfers from your mobile account: internet, communal services, communication, TV, loans, etc. 
This service is available for lifecell subscribers who are served on individual tariff plans on the terms of an oral and written agreement.
Paycell mobile application allows lifecell subscribers to use mobile funds to pay for popular products or services. This is a convenient and secure way to pay for more than 1000 services with a favorable commission.

Security:
For the security of your funds, each transaction is verified using one-time transaction confirmation password delivered via SMS to your mobile phone.

What you can do with Paycell:
Money transfers to the card of any bank of Ukraine;
Replenishment of mobile account;
Replenishment of game account balances;
Payment of bills for the Internet, TV, telephony;
Payment for utilities;
Repayment of the loan and payment of insurance payments;
Payment of fines, etc.

